%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56d596c8d8b1a3f4e8b6c1601d9cdc15, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 61312303640576
    m_Localized: she's on the shelf over the stove now. i dust her. don't tell Orik i dust her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000704
    m_Localized: is that... you found her! give her here. careful. no, carefuller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000705
    m_Localized: not a scratch on her. well. the usual number of scratches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000706
    m_Localized: so what's the research, Boog?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000707
    m_Localized: she's all yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000708
    m_Localized: ...she's the first thing i ever made that went off when i meant her to. before her, things went off when they wanted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000709
    m_Localized: Old Phi let me keep her. she said everyone needs one thing that does what they hoped it would.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000710
    m_Localized: here. for your trouble. i was saving it for fuses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000711
    m_Localized: you went all the way down for her. i won't forget it, keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000712
    m_Localized: any sign of her? round, black, smoking a little. she won't come if you call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000713
    m_Localized: i'll keep looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000714
    m_Localized: first floor of the Cellars, a couple of fights in. that's where the spiders and i disagreed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000715
    m_Localized: i lost something in the Hollows. my favorite bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000716
    m_Localized: your favorite bomb?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000717
    m_Localized: where did you lose her?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000718
    m_Localized: you don't have a favorite bomb? huh. well, she's mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000719
    m_Localized: in the Cellars, first floor, a couple of fights in. the spiders and i had a disagreement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000720
    m_Localized: will you bring her back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000721
    m_Localized: i'll bring her back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000722
    m_Localized: what do you need her for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000723
    m_Localized: not now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000724
    m_Localized: you will? she's round, black, and her fuse is still going. that's normal. don't worry about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000725
    m_Localized: research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000726
    m_Localized: what research?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000727
    m_Localized: the private kind. will you look or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000728
    m_Localized: she'll keep. she's very patient, for a bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000729
    m_Localized: you hung the Larder Troll's tusks over the bar. i've been looking at them for an hour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000730
    m_Localized: if the stove catches fire again, they're the first thing i'm saving. after the bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000731
    m_Localized: they do look good up there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000732
    m_Localized: they look terrifying. that's what good looks like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000733
    m_Localized: again? the stove's been on fire?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000734
    m_Localized: only the once. twice. it's fine, i was there both times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000735
    m_Localized: the hatch is upstairs, in your room. you can't miss it. people do miss it, and then they fall in. that works too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000736
    m_Localized: the stove's hot. the stove's always hot. that's how you know it's working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000737
    m_Localized: about your bomb...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000738
    m_Localized: carry on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000739
    m_Localized: the tusks over the bar are a right talking point. a guest asked if they bite. i said only on weekends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000740
    m_Localized: do they?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000741
    m_Localized: i havenae checked. i'm no' going to check, either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000742
    m_Localized: the hatch is in your floor upstairs. i'll be down here, counting things. it's what i'm for, ken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000743
    m_Localized: Boog's bomb is home. i've put it in the incident book. in advance, mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000744
    m_Localized: good evening, [lua(HH_PlayerName())]. the ledger and me are on speaking terms again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000745
    m_Localized: tell me about Phi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000746
    m_Localized: why won't you go down?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000747
    m_Localized: how are the books?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000748
    m_Localized: never mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000749
    m_Localized: we rebuilt this place together, long ago. she'd been one of the Fortunate Five. the road kept calling her, aye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000750
    m_Localized: my kin went down for three hundred years. somebody had to come up and count what they left behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000751
    m_Localized: in the red. a cheery sort of red, mind. we've had worse reds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000752
    m_Localized: ahh, you must be [lua(HH_PlayerName())]! Phi's letter said you'd come. it didnae say you'd be this late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000753
    m_Localized: the road was long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000754
    m_Localized: where is Phi'rai?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000755
    m_Localized: aye, that's the question, isn't it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000756
    m_Localized: nine days ago she went down into the Hollows. a week at most, she said. Phi is never late. never, in all these years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000757
    m_Localized: if she's no' back, Tally Ho! is yours, her room upstairs an' all. you're the keeper now. i'm Orik. i keep the books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000758
    m_Localized: and i'm Boog! i keep the fire. mostly in the stove.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000759
    m_Localized: Boog cooks. Boog also keeps a list of the things he's set alight. it's longer than the menu, mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000760
    m_Localized: and we cannae open without food. the storeroom holds three onions and a smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000761
    m_Localized: the smell's mine. i'm keeping it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000762
    m_Localized: but the hatch is right upstairs, in your room! down there, everything's an ingredient if you're brave about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000763
    m_Localized: i dinnae go down. my kin went down for three hundred years. i came up. i'm staying up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000764
    m_Localized: bring back anything with meat on it. or teeth. i can work with teeth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000765
    m_Localized: i'll go down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000766
    m_Localized: you're back! and you brought... let me see. oh. oh, that's a whole supper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000767
    m_Localized: i've counted it. by my sums that's an evening. a wee one, but an evening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000768
    m_Localized: you see? the Hollows go in, supper comes out. that's all cooking is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000769
    m_Localized: Phi used tae come up that hatch smelling just like you do now. i never asked what of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000770
    m_Localized: what else did she bring up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000771
    m_Localized: what do i smell like?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000772
    m_Localized: answers, whiles. never tae anything i'd asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000773
    m_Localized: deep. you smell deep. it's a good smell on a cook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000774
    m_Localized: you're back! that's the important part. the other important part was food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000775
    m_Localized: the Hollows keep what you drop. the books are taking it fine. so am i.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000776
    m_Localized: tomorrow we fry the onions and serve them with confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000777
    m_Localized: away up to your bed. we open tomorrow evening. i'll have the board ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000778
    m_Localized: the board's yours. pick tonight's dishes from what's in the storeroom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000779
    m_Localized: you cook at the stations, put it on the pass, carry it to whoever's hungry. want me on a station? just say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000780
    m_Localized: they pay once they're fed. i'll be on the floor too. try no' to be slower than me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000781
    m_Localized: that's the first night's takings. Phi's first night was worse. i've got it written down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000782
    m_Localized: she used tae say the first night is for finding out what's wrong wi' the second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000783
    m_Localized: keeper. can i ask you something? a small thing. a medium thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111848087552
    m_Localized: you killed the Larder Troll. the actual Larder Troll. the one that eats the Cellars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807808
    m_Localized: first my bomb, now the troll. you're the best thing to happen to this kitchen since the stove.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807809
    m_Localized: i've said for years it was edible. now it's dead, and i'm right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807810
    m_Localized: is it edible?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807811
    m_Localized: it nearly ate me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807812
    m_Localized: parts of it. the brave parts. i'll find out which.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807813
    m_Localized: nearly. best word in the language.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807814
    m_Localized: i told her about you. the bomb. i tell her things. she's a good listener, for a bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807815
    m_Localized: someone asked for something special and got it. i heard them say thank you. over the stove. the stove's loud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807816
    m_Localized: i saw you at the block. clean cuts. you didn't flinch at the gristle. i flinch at the gristle, and i love gristle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807817
    m_Localized: you could work my stove. don't. but you could.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807818
    m_Localized: aye, the Larder Troll is dead. i've moved it from 'risks' to 'resolved'. first entry in that column in years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807819
    m_Localized: Phi went after it, ken. twice. she came back both times and wouldnae say a word about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807820
    m_Localized: what was she after?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807821
    m_Localized: she'll come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807822
    m_Localized: no' the troll, she said. whatever it was sitting on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807823
    m_Localized: she always has. i keep her chair dusted. dinnae tell Boog i dust things. he'll want to compare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807824
    m_Localized: you remembered that patron's request, and made it. folk come back to places that remember them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807825
    m_Localized: Phi ran it that way. i'd started tae think i was the only one who remembered how.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168473641889792
    m_Localized: she left, and i kept the place open without her for years. when the Hollows turned bad, i left an' all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168473700610048
    m_Localized: decades later she came home, found me, and said i was late for work. so back i came.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056222302208
    m_Localized: Phi'rai. Old Phi, to anyone who wanted to keep their teeth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439552
    m_Localized: five tankards, polished, on a shelf nobody drinks from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439553
    m_Localized: the way down, in the floor of your room. the Hollows can wait for dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439554
    m_Localized: Karias. the letters are worn smooth where people touch them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439555
    m_Localized: that's five, then. the village is putting its boots by the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439556
    m_Localized: we open when you say so. i'll be here, counting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398522646528
    m_Localized: ah. Phi's new keeper. Orik said you would find the cart. he says everyone does. eventually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589568
    m_Localized: i am Musashi. i sell what grows, what is caught, and what Grim swears is fresh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589569
    m_Localized: you knew Phi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589570
    m_Localized: what's good today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589571
    m_Localized: we were five, once. Phi, Grim, me, two more. people called us the Fortunate Five. we were. mostly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589572
    m_Localized: everything, i am told. i cannot taste. not one thing. the Hollows took it. so you must tell me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589573
    m_Localized: ohayo, [lua(HH_PlayerName())]-san. onions are loud today. a good onion, you can hear. if you listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589574
    m_Localized: how do you cook without tasting?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589575
    m_Localized: what happened, down there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589576
    m_Localized: any family?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589577
    m_Localized: when do you close?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589578
    m_Localized: see you later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589579
    m_Localized: i do not cook, now. i smell. i listen. i watch faces. your face will do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589580
    m_Localized: something down there loved my cooking too much. it took the taste for itself. i hope it chokes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589581
    m_Localized: so. now i sell. someone should make something good with all this. even if i cannot tell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589582
    m_Localized: a brother. Toshi. he went deeper than any of us. he has not come back up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589583
    m_Localized: if you hear his name, below... tell me. this is all i ask. onegai.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387398564589584
    m_Localized: at five. after that, onions need their sleep. so do i. hai.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659352690688
    m_Localized: hark! the new keeper of Tally Ho!, the watch's own tavern! Kariaston bids you welcome, by my mouth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856512
    m_Localized: 'i am Maximo: founder of this village, mayor of it, and its watchman, until the Hollows close or i do.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856513
    m_Localized: you founded Kariaston?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856514
    m_Localized: a watchman? over what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856515
    m_Localized: i named it. the building was mostly other people. i gave speeches while they lifted things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856516
    m_Localized: it's named for Karias. my apprentice. he was better than me. i don't say that often. i say it to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856517
    m_Localized: over what lies under your tavern, and under that. someone must watch it. i volunteered, long ago, loudly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856518
    m_Localized: i don't go down anymore. you will. so we keep watch from both ends, you and i.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856519
    m_Localized: now! go forth and be magnificent. or open at five. either is a service to the realm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856520
    m_Localized: the Larder Troll, felled by a keeper of my own village! i shall have a song written. Bart will refuse. i'll write it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856521
    m_Localized: 'and keeper: come back up. every time. that''s the part of the song that matters.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856522
    m_Localized: five nights below, and up again each morning. keep doing that part. i'll keep a lamp lit at this end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856523
    m_Localized: 'good morning, keeper! today''s proclamation: the weather is adequate. the realm rejoices.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856524
    m_Localized: ah, the keeper of this fine house! the soup is a triumph. i've proclaimed it. Orik has added it to my book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856525
    m_Localized: 'i''m watching your tavern. not you: the tavern, and what''s under it. carry on being watched.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856526
    m_Localized: evening, keeper. i stand with him a while at dusk. he never liked the dark coming on alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856527
    m_Localized: the watchman's day is done. the watch never is. that's the sort of thing i say at bedtime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856528
    m_Localized: tell me about Karias.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856529
    m_Localized: any proclamations?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856530
    m_Localized: good day, Maximo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856531
    m_Localized: he held his staff like a wish come true. the best wizard i ever taught. the only one, but still.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856532
    m_Localized: the statue gets his nose wrong. i keep meaning to say. i never do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856533
    m_Localized: 'by order of the mayor: nobody is to be glum before noon. after noon, glum in moderation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856534
    m_Localized: 'oh, hello. you must be the new keeper. i''m Kaloren. i live in the tower: the tall thing with the pointed hat.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856535
    m_Localized: if anything at Tally Ho! needs mending, or warming, or gently persuading, do knock. i like to be useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856536
    m_Localized: can you light the stove?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856537
    m_Localized: thank you, Kaloren.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856538
    m_Localized: i can make it warm. i don't do fire. fire and i had a disagreement once, and fire won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856539
    m_Localized: not at all. it's good to see a light on at Tally Ho! again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856540
    m_Localized: the Cellars under you have lovely stonework. the arches were better before the third collapse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856541
    m_Localized: the third collapse?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856542
    m_Localized: did i say third? the second. i read a great deal. very old books. dreadfully old.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856543
    m_Localized: ...forgive me. i was listening so hard i forgot to breathe. it happens at my age.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856544
    m_Localized: good morning. i was tidying the stairs. there are rather a lot of them. it keeps an old man honest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856545
    m_Localized: i'm reading about the Cellars. whoever wrote this has never been in them. charming, though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856546
    m_Localized: ah, keeper. Ogrin's herbs. every third day, like the post. they help him. they don't mend him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856547
    m_Localized: hello again, keeper. a fine day for it, whatever it turns out to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856548
    m_Localized: where do the herbs grow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856549
    m_Localized: will they cure him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856550
    m_Localized: why the gloves? it's warm out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856551
    m_Localized: see you, Kaloren.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856552
    m_Localized: here and there. the shy ones grow in cold places. i'm good with cold places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856553
    m_Localized: no. i wish they would. they give him good days, and good days are worth a great deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856554
    m_Localized: i feel the cold terribly. or rather, i don't, which is worse. never mind. lovely day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856555
    m_Localized: you're Phi's keeper. aye, i heard. the whole village heard. Maximo made a speech at the well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856556
    m_Localized: Grim. i live in the brown house with the boy. if he asks you for stories, tell him the true ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856557
    m_Localized: you knew Phi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856558
    m_Localized: the boy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856559
    m_Localized: i delved with her, a long while back. her, Musashi and the rest. that's all you'll get on an empty stomach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856560
    m_Localized: Ogrin. he's mine. no' by blood. he'll talk your ear off about the Hollows. he's never been. he'll no' be going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856561
    m_Localized: Kaloren's been by with the herbs. never takes a coin. never says where he picks them. i never ask. we get on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856562
    m_Localized: let's see your knife. ...aye. that'll do. keep it dry, and dinnae lend it to Boog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856563
    m_Localized: morning. splitting stone for the wall. it doesnae need splitting. i need to split it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856564
    m_Localized: Musashi's onions are fine today. i told him so. he cannae taste them, so someone has to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856565
    m_Localized: watching the boy. from over here, so he doesnae know. he knows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856566
    m_Localized: evening. the boy's in. the kettle's on. that's the day done, near enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856567
    m_Localized: you were a delver?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856568
    m_Localized: how's Ogrin?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856569
    m_Localized: see you, Grim.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856570
    m_Localized: aye. a lot of years. then one time i came back up with more than i went down with, and i stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856571
    m_Localized: good day today. he's out. dinnae tell him i said so; he'll think he's cured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856572
    m_Localized: tired. it comes and it goes. Kaloren's herbs help. nothing fixes it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856573
    m_Localized: oh! it's you. the keeper. i'm in bed. it's not catching. it's just me. what's down the hatch? the real stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856574
    m_Localized: you're the new keeper! you go down the hatch! every night! what's down there? the real stuff, not the Grim version.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856575
    m_Localized: slimes, mostly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856576
    m_Localized: it's dangerous down there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856577
    m_Localized: i knew it! i drew slimes on my map. Grim said i was guessing. i was guessing correctly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856578
    m_Localized: everyone says that. i know what dangerous is. i'm asking what it looks like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856579
    m_Localized: come back and tell me things. i've got the Cellars mostly right. the rest is dragons till i know better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856580
    m_Localized: you killed the Larder Troll? how big? bigger than Grim? bigger than the cart? i'm drawing it bigger than the cart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856581
    m_Localized: Kaloren brought the leaves. they taste like a cellar. they work, though. tomorrow's a going-out day, probably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856582
    m_Localized: is it true Boog keeps a bomb on a shelf? does it have a name? it should have a name. i'd call it Gerald.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856583
    m_Localized: Grim's splitting the same rock again. he says it's for the wall. there is no wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856584
    m_Localized: i'm drawing the Hollows. this is the Cellars. this is where i think the troll lives. tell me if i'm wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856585
    m_Localized: Bart's playing the one about the goat. it's my favorite. the goat wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856586
    m_Localized: i'm all right. i'm tired in a way sleeping doesn't fix. don't make the face. everyone makes the face.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856587
    m_Localized: Grim says bed. i say the moon's barely up. Grim wins. Grim always wins. good night, keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856588
    m_Localized: what's on your map?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856589
    m_Localized: how are you feeling?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856590
    m_Localized: bye, Ogrin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856591
    m_Localized: 'a lot of question marks. you could fix some. i''ll trade you: one true story, one of my drawings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856592
    m_Localized: fine. i'm always fine, then i'm not, then i am again. ask me something interesting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856593
    m_Localized: well now, howdy. you're the keeper. i'm Bart. i play a little, sing a little, and listen a whole lot more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856594
    m_Localized: i was passing through on my way someplace else. played one night at Tally Ho!, and i'm still fixing to leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856595
    m_Localized: what do you sing about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856596
    m_Localized: why did you stay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856597
    m_Localized: folks. ordinary ones. a song about a hero's just a list. a baker who's scared of bread, now that's a song.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856598
    m_Localized: Phi fed me, and folks here kept being interesting. a fellow can't leave in the middle of a good story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856599
    m_Localized: you do anything worth a verse, i'll hear about it. i always hear about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856600
    m_Localized: 'heard you laid out the Larder Troll. i''m working on a verse. tell me true: did it roar, or did it scream?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856601
    m_Localized: it roared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856602
    m_Localized: it screamed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856603
    m_Localized: roared it is. a scream don't rhyme with nothing, and a roar rhymes with Orik's floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856604
    m_Localized: screamed, huh. i'll put roared. folks want a troll to keep a little dignity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856605
    m_Localized: Maximo asked me to write a song about him. i said i'd think on it. i've been thinking on it a good long while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856606
    m_Localized: morning. just tuning. this string's been sharp since spring. i reckon it's got opinions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856607
    m_Localized: Grim says Musashi's onions are fine. Musashi says Grim's fine. that's about as close as those two get to a hug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856608
    m_Localized: this one's about the goat. Ogrin's favorite. the goat wins every verse. that goat's got grit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856609
    m_Localized: evening, keeper. the wagon's warm and the song's half done. come by tomorrow, i'll have the other half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856610
    m_Localized: any news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856611
    m_Localized: a song about the Fortunate Five?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856612
    m_Localized: see you, Bart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856613
    m_Localized: Maximo proclaimed the weather adequate again. that's three days running. folks worry he's going soft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 441659377856614
    m_Localized: half of one. i won't sing the half i don't know. making things up about real folks gets you a black eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435344343040
    m_Localized: oh. you're awake. don't shout. Boog's asleep, and he sleeps light. for a goblin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508864
    m_Localized: i saw you go down tonight. and come back up. most don't, the first few times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508865
    m_Localized: who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508866
    m_Localized: you just climbed out of my floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508867
    m_Localized: Gimp. i live down there, mostly. up here, sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508868
    m_Localized: it was Phi's floor. it had a hatch in it. i didn't build the house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508869
    m_Localized: where's Phi? i haven't seen her in a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508870
    m_Localized: she went below. no word since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508871
    m_Localized: i was hoping you'd know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435369508872
    m_Localized: ...gone down. and nobody thought to tell me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703168
    m_Localized: she and i had an arrangement. i come up her hatch, i see Boog, i have a drink, i go back down. nobody screams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703169
    m_Localized: this is my bedroom now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703170
    m_Localized: does Boog know you're here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703171
    m_Localized: it's still a good arrangement. it just needs a new name on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703172
    m_Localized: Boog always knows. it's the only sensible thing about him. that, and the powder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703173
    m_Localized: if she turns up, tell her Gimp asked. don't tell her i asked twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703174
    m_Localized: go back to sleep, keeper. i know my own way down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703175
    m_Localized: heard you put the Larder Troll down. not bad. for someone from up here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703176
    m_Localized: keeper. Boog says you can cook. Boog says a lot of things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703177
    m_Localized: what.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703178
    m_Localized: how do you know Boog?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703179
    m_Localized: any word of Phi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703180
    m_Localized: do you know Maximo?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703181
    m_Localized: i'll leave you to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703182
    m_Localized: he blew up a tunnel i was standing in. i liked him at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703183
    m_Localized: if i had any, you'd be the second to know. Boog's first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703184
    m_Localized: the old tin can. don't say that name in this house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703185
    m_Localized: what did he do to you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703186
    m_Localized: nothing you'd understand. drop it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703187
    m_Localized: go on, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703188
    m_Localized: the keeper killed the troll, Grim!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703189
    m_Localized: aye, i heard. dinnae get ideas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703190
    m_Localized: the leaves taste like a cellar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703191
    m_Localized: then they're working. drink up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703192
    m_Localized: can i see the Hollows today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703193
    m_Localized: no.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703194
    m_Localized: tomorrow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703195
    m_Localized: ask me tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703196
    m_Localized: steep them, Grim. don't boil them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703197
    m_Localized: aye. i know. thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703198
    m_Localized: you always say that like it costs you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703199
    m_Localized: write one about Boog's bomb!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703200
    m_Localized: a love song, then. it'd have to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703201
    m_Localized: play the goat one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703202
    m_Localized: the goat one it is. third time today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703203
    m_Localized: the goat deserves it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703204
    m_Localized: heard the keeper laid out the Larder Troll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703205
    m_Localized: troll is tough meat. long stew. i hope keeper knows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703206
    m_Localized: how're the onions today, Musashi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703207
    m_Localized: loud. Grim says good. i trust Grim's nose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703208
    m_Localized: might put that in a song.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703209
    m_Localized: please, no.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703210
    m_Localized: Musashi! a fine morning for commerce!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703211
    m_Localized: every morning, you say. every morning, true.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703212
    m_Localized: Orik! put it on my account!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703213
    m_Localized: aye. your account has its own book now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703214
    m_Localized: a fine book!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703215
    m_Localized: a thick one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703216
    m_Localized: you got the old girl back, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703217
    m_Localized: the keeper went all the way down for her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703218
    m_Localized: ...huh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703219
    m_Localized: Maximo was in for lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703220
    m_Localized: don't say that name while i'm drinking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703221
    m_Localized: Gimp! did you bring powder?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703222
    m_Localized: half. the other half went off in a tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703223
    m_Localized: a good tunnel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539435373703224
    m_Localized: it was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539923167064064
    m_Localized: my light came again. no, i won't say what it is. i don't know what it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754144665600
    m_Localized: there you are. the day's yours till evening, keeper. nobody wants supper at breakfast, ken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754186608640
    m_Localized: Kariaston's out the front door. Musashi keeps his cart in the square from eight till five.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754186608641
    m_Localized: the garden's out back. four beds. dig, plant, wait. very boring. very good onions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754186608642
    m_Localized: digging and planting take it out of you, mind. there's only so much Vigor in a day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754186608643
    m_Localized: walking is free. talking is free. sleep fills you back up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754186608644
    m_Localized: and when you're ready to open, the menu board by the door starts the evening. no hurry, aye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717754186608645
    m_Localized: the pots are in a hurry. but fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
